
(..0) business as usual in the Senate
(1..1) a vague disquiet in the corridors
(2..2) unease that no one can name
(3..3) <span style="color: #e0745a;">a shadow over the Senate</span>
(4..4) <span style="color: #d24a4a;">a darkness clouding every vision</span>
(5..) <span style="color: #b3141b;">the dark side is ascendant</span>
